<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #1a1a1a;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f5f5f5;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      border: 1px solid #eeeeee;
    }
    .header {
      background: #1a1a2e;
      padding: 32px 30px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #ffffff;
      border-bottom: 4px solid #636b2f;
    }
    .header h1 { margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; }
    .header p  { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.7; }
    .content { padding: 36px 30px 28px; }
    .timestamp-box {
      background: #f5f5f5;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 12px 18px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #555;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .reason-box {
      background: #fff5f5;
      border-left: 4px solid #d9534f;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #2d3748;
    }
    .reason-box strong { color: #d9534f; }
    .impact-box {
      background: #f9fafb;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    .impact-box p {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #444;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    }
    .impact-box ul {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
    }
    .impact-box li {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #555;
      padding: 6px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;
    }
    .impact-box li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .win-back-box {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f9fff3, #ffffff);
      border: 1px solid #bac095;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: center;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    .win-back-box h3 {
      margin: 0 0 8px 0;
      font-size: 17px;
      color: #1a1a1a;
    }
    .win-back-box p {
      margin: 0 0 18px 0;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #666;
    }
    .btn-reactivate {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 13px 28px;
      background-color: #636b2f;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 15px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(99,107,47,0.3);
    }
    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px 30px;
      background-color: #f9fafb;
      color: #888;
      font-size: 12px;
      border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
    }
    .footer a { color: #636b2f; text-decoration: none; }
  </style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f5f5f5;">

  <div class="container" style="background-color:#ffffff;">

    <div class="header" style="background:#1a1a2e; padding:32px 30px; text-align:center; color:#ffffff; border-bottom:4px solid #636b2f;">
      <h1 style="margin:0 0 6px 0; font-size:24px; font-weight:800;">Account Deactivated</h1>
      <p style="margin:0; font-size:13px; opacity:0.7;">Your FormaChat account has been deactivated</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content" style="padding:36px 30px 28px;">

      <p style="font-size:16px; margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#1a1a1a;">Hello,</p>
      <p style="font-size:15px; margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#444;">
        This confirms that your FormaChat account was deactivated on <strong>{{deactivatedAt}}</strong>.
      </p>

      {{#if reason}}
      <div class="reason-box" style="background:#fff5f5; border-left:4px solid #d9534f; border-radius:6px; padding:14px 18px; margin:20px 0; font-size:14px; color:#2d3748;">
        <strong style="color:#d9534f;">Reason:</strong> {{reason}}
      </div>
      {{/if}}

      <div class="impact-box" style="background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:18px 20px; margin:24px 0;">
        <p style="font-size:13px; font-weight:700; color:#444; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.5px; margin:0 0 12px 0;">What this means</p>
        <ul style="margin:0; padding:0; list-style:none;">
          <li style="font-size:14px; color:#555; padding:8px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;">❌ You can no longer access your account or dashboard.</li>
          <li style="font-size:14px; color:#555; padding:8px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;">🤖 All your AI agents have been taken offline.</li>
          <li style="font-size:14px; color:#555; padding:8px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;">💬 Any active chat widgets on your sites will stop responding.</li>
          <li style="font-size:14px; color:#555; padding:8px 0;">✅ You will not be billed for any future charges.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="win-back-box" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f9fff3,#ffffff); border:1px solid #bac095; border-radius:10px; padding:24px; text-align:center; margin:24px 0;">
        <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px 0; font-size:17px; color:#1a1a1a;">Think this was a mistake?</h3>
        <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0; font-size:13px; color:#666;">
          We'd love to have you back. Reach out and we'll get your account restored and your agents back online right away.
        </p>
        <a href="mailto:support@formachat.com?subject=Reactivate%20My%20FormaChat%20Account"
           class="btn-reactivate"
           style="display:inline-block; padding:13px 28px; background-color:#636b2f; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; border-radius:6px; font-weight:700; font-size:15px; box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(99,107,47,0.3);">
          Reactivate My Account
        </a>
      </div>

      <p style="margin-top:4px; font-size:15px; color:#1a1a1a;">We're sorry to see you go,<br>The FormaChat Team</p>

    </div>

    <div class="footer" style="text-align:center; padding:20px 30px; background-color:#f9fafb; color:#888; font-size:12px; border-top:1px solid #eee;">
      <p style="margin:4px 0;">&copy; {{currentYear}} FormaChat. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p style="margin:4px 0;">Questions? <a href="mailto:support@formachat.com" style="color:#636b2f; text-decoration:none;">support@formachat.com</a></p>
    </div>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
